00:02:20,410 --> 00:02:25,910
Episode 38:
TAKE THEM DOWN! TACHIBANA Twins

54
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:22,870
2-1!

55
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:27,120
Hanawa MS reduced the gap to one with an incredible technique.

56
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:31,460
Did you see that? This is our Skylab Hurricane move!

57
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:35,130
This is the power of the twins! The best shot you'll ever see!

58
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:38,930
Damn it. They're right. They've really improved their technique.

59
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:41,270
This move isn't just an improvement; it's a brand-new move.

60
00:02:41,270 --> 00:02:47,140
Both Masao and Kazuo have been working hard to pull off this shot since that day.

61
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:54,880
We did it, right, Masao?

62
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,850
Pulling it off once isn't enough.

63
00:02:56,850 --> 00:02:58,370
Come on, let's do it again!

64
00:02:58,370 --> 00:03:00,320
Are you serious? But our legs...

65
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:05,200
This time I'll be on the bottom and you jump.

66
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,830
Okay then...

67
00:03:06,830 --> 00:03:08,830
That's enough, guys.

68
00:03:08,830 --> 00:03:10,500
You can continue tomorrow.

69
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:15,940
No! If we can't do it every time, it doesn't count as success.

70
00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:19,170
He's right! If we don't do it, we can't win.

71
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:20,440
Go!

72
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,170
Okay!

73
00:03:21,950 --> 00:03:24,850
We know how hard they've worked.

74
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:35,120
The only thing we can do is provide full support with all our might for the Skylab Hurricane.

75
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,320
Yes!

76
00:03:39,990 --> 00:03:42,350
That was a great move!

77
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:45,450
It seemed like it had no weak points.

78
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:48,510
So this is the Tachibana Twins' new move...

79
00:03:48,510 --> 00:03:51,060
You can't call that a surprise attack.

80
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:54,100
Yeah. With this move, it's impossible for them to fail an attack.

81
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:54,750
Yes.

82
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:57,130
