84
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:08,180
Skylab Hurricane, huh...

85
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:11,020
Hey, were you able to catch it?

86
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:15,360
Yeah, I've never seen anything so incredible before.

87
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:20,860
In their previous technique, they would turn and jump off the goalpost.

88
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:23,530
It was difficult to shoot from that position.

89
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:27,820
So they would pass to the other and make a triangular passing play.

90
00:04:28,410 --> 00:04:34,880
But in this new technique, they can directly use the power of the jump.

91
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:39,840
You can't stop this with a simple move like hitting the goalpost.

92
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,220
The match has become quite interesting.

93
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:44,260
How will Nankatsu respond?

94
00:04:44,890 --> 00:04:48,260
What kind of game will Tsubasa play?

95
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:50,690
Now, let's calm down.

96
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:55,420
