269
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:18,400
Guys, are you okay?

270
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:20,650
Yes!

271
00:13:21,290 --> 00:13:22,820
I'm... fine.

272
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:24,650
I'm... fine.

273
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:26,570
This isn't good.

274
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:28,320
Your shoulder might be dislocated.

275
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:31,560
You should go to the infirmary right away.

276
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,800
A small thing like this won't stop me...

277
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,540
Tsubasa!

278
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:39,000
I'm fine...

279
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,380
I'm going to continue playing.

280
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:43,880
I absolutely will continue!

281
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,970
Kid...

282
00:13:44,970 --> 00:13:47,170
Tsubasa, that's impossible.

283
00:13:47,170 --> 00:13:48,890
Your face is pale too.

284
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:50,590
Get treatment and come back.

285
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:53,210
Yeah, we'll hold the fort until then.

286
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:54,780
No.

287
00:13:54,780 --> 00:13:56,520
They're right.

288
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:58,580
Go to the infirmary right now.

289
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,290
This is an order.

290
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:04,190
If you refuse, I'll take you out of the game.

291
00:14:06,010 --> 00:14:07,260
Alright, so be it.

292
00:14:07,260 --> 00:14:08,450
Understood...

293
00:14:08,450 --> 00:14:10,120
Sorry, guys.

294
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,610
I'll be back before you notice.

295
00:14:11,610 --> 00:14:15,080
I'll be right back.

296
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,960
Trust us!

297
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:23,590
It seems Tsubasa is leaving the game due to his injury.

298
00:14:23,590 --> 00:14:24,820
What?!

299
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:30,830
Nankatsu prevented the goal, but they may have paid a huge price for it.

300
00:14:30,830 --> 00:14:33,250
Football is a cruel sport.

301
00:14:33,250 --> 00:14:36,990
The match will continue while he gets treatment.

302
00:14:36,990 --> 00:14:38,700
Tsubasa...

303
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:39,810
Sanae!

304
00:14:39,810 --> 00:14:42,020
Nankatsu is in danger.

305
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:43,770
Tsubasa...

306
00:14:43,770 --> 00:14:45,690
This is a disaster...

307
00:14:45,690 --> 00:14:48,510
Nankatsu is cornered.

308
00:14:48,510 --> 00:14:54,370
If he's seriously injured, he might not be able to play for the rest of the tournament.

309
00:14:56,700 --> 00:15:01,000
Hanawa will take the corner kick.

310
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,660
They will definitely use their technique.

311
00:15:03,660 --> 00:15:04,990
That's for sure.

312
00:15:04,990 --> 00:15:06,640
Taki and I will stop them.

313
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:08,260
Yeah, let's show them!

314
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:09,200
Alright, guys!

315
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:13,090
Listen, until Tsubasa returns, we won't let them score no matter what!

316
00:15:13,090 --> 00:15:13,680
Okay!

317
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:17,960
Tsubasa might have gotten injured saving you, but listen...

318
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,890
We won't hold back.

319
00:15:19,890 --> 00:15:22,010
That's the rule of battle.

320
00:15:22,010 --> 00:15:23,690
I know, Kazuo.

321
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:28,360
Let's do the Skylab Hurricane once more!

322
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:35,330
INFIRMARY

323
00:15:35,330 --> 00:15:36,560
What?

324
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:37,930
What's going on inside?

325
00:15:39,070 --> 00:15:41,870
Oh! This...!

326
00:15:43,290 --> 00:15:44,220
What?!

327
00:15:44,220 --> 00:15:45,710
Is that allowed?

328
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:50,410
Nankatsu is employing a very bold strategy!

329
00:15:50,410 --> 00:15:53,470
Kisugi and Taki are waiting on top of the goal.

330
00:15:53,470 --> 00:15:56,930
A nice tactic to stop the Skylab Hurricane.

331
00:15:56,930 --> 00:15:59,160
The tactic Tsubasa gave us...

332
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:01,450
We can't do what he did,

333
00:16:01,450 --> 00:16:04,030
but we can climb up in advance!

334
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:07,070
We will stop the Skylab Hurricane.

335
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,060
Interesting!

336
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:10,880
Jump if you want!

337
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:13,280
Come on, Daimaru!

338
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:13,950
Of course!

339
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:17,120
Now Masao is on the ground!

340
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,300
Alright! Kisugi, Taki!

341
00:16:19,300 --> 00:16:21,640
Jump with all your might and stop them!

342
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:22,580
Okay!

343
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:23,710
Here it comes!

344
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:26,460
This time he's sending a low ball!

345
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,590
What?!

346
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:28,840
I'm coming!

347
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:33,880
The Skylab Hurricane isn't just about jumping high!

348
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:36,640
We can jump under any conditions!

349
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:45,020
Go, Low-Flying Skylab Hurricane!

350
00:16:45,430 --> 00:16:48,520
Kazuo jumps lightly from behind.

351
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,760
Lightly?

352
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:50,650
We'll stop him!

353
00:16:55,110 --> 00:16:58,020
The ball is in the net! Hanawa finds their second goal in the second half!

354
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:01,540
They equalized in the 7th minute of the second half!

355
00:17:02,430 --> 00:17:04,050
That's it! It's a draw!

356
00:17:04,050 --> 00:17:05,670
Finally!

357
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:08,170
Nice shot, Masao, Kazuo!

358
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:10,290
The Skylab Hurricane is unstoppable!

359
00:17:10,290 --> 00:17:12,140
Great, we can take this match.

360
00:17:12,140 --> 00:17:15,260
If we keep this up, we can beat Nankatsu!

361
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:17,620
Alright! Let's turn the match around!

362
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,260
This isn't good.

363
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:21,560
If they can jump from any angle,

364
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:23,480
it's pointless for us to try and stop them!

365
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,730
INFIRMARY

366
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:30,040
I guess you heard their screams.

367
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:33,200
I just forced it a little. Nothing to worry about.

368
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:39,370
Doctor, will he be able to continue the match?

369
00:17:39,370 --> 00:17:40,060
Huh?

370
00:17:40,060 --> 00:17:41,290
Yes.

371
00:17:41,290 --> 00:17:45,200
This treatment will get him back in the game.

372
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:49,920
Nankatsu is, after all, a team built around Tsubasa Ozora.

373
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:54,810
They can't win this tournament without their captain.

374
00:17:54,810 --> 00:17:56,130
Isn't that right, captain?

375
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,300
Yes.

376
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:58,390
Oh...

377
00:17:59,310 --> 00:18:05,390
I'll bandage it, but you should move it as little as possible.

378
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:09,450
Also, you mustn't jump that high again.

379
00:18:09,450 --> 00:18:10,150
Yes.

380
00:18:10,150 --> 00:18:14,420
If your shoulder gets dislocated again in the same way,

381
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:17,490
you won't be able to play for the rest of the match.

382
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:21,140
I won't allow you to go back out there.

383
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:22,240
Keep that in mind, okay?

384
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,410
Understood.

385
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,260
Thank you very much.

386
00:18:28,250 --> 00:18:29,010
Hm?

387
00:18:31,810 --> 00:18:33,880
Do your best, Tsubasa.

388
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,590
Of course.

389
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:39,590
Tsubasa.

390
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:40,850
Are you okay?

391
00:18:40,850 --> 00:18:42,100
How's the game?

392
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:43,920
A draw, huh.

393
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,520
They couldn't hold them.

394
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:49,020
The Skylab Hurricane can be done from any angle.

395
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:51,230
What? Any angle?

396
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:52,080
To you!

397
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:52,860
Got it!

398
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:54,510
They suddenly took the ball!

399
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,230
Stop them!

400
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:57,320
Come on, let's turn the match around right away!

401
00:19:00,950 --> 00:19:02,160
Tsubasa!

402
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:06,910
Tsubasa has finished his treatment and is standing by, ready to enter the game.

403
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:09,850
Guys, focus on the game!

404
00:19:09,850 --> 00:19:12,040
I'll fight alongside you too!

405
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:12,930
Damn it.

406
00:19:12,930 --> 00:19:14,800
So he can keep playing.

407
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:15,950
Tsubasa!

408
00:19:15,950 --> 00:19:18,320
It wouldn't be fun any other way.

409
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,170
Yes.

410
00:19:19,170 --> 00:19:22,620
If the play doesn't stop, Tsubasa can't enter the game.

411
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,680
We have to take the lead before he comes in.

412
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:27,930
And of course, we'll do it with the Skylab Hurricane!

413
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:29,210
They're coming again.

414
00:19:29,210 --> 00:19:31,480
Don't let them lob the ball!

415
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,440
Yes!

416
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:35,480
Nankatsu is going to mark Daimaru!

417
00:19:35,890 --> 00:19:36,610
Here.

418
00:19:38,320 --> 00:19:39,150
It's coming!

419
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:41,950
This time Aimoto lobbed the ball!

420
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:42,910
Damn it!

421
00:19:46,870 --> 00:19:48,450
I'm coming, Masao!

422
00:19:49,290 --> 00:19:52,460
A hopeless situation for Nankatsu!

423
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:53,420
Guys!

424
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:57,170
Come on, Skylab...!

425
00:19:57,170 --> 00:19:57,960
They did it!

426
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,170
The match is turning!

427
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:01,720
Ah!

428
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:03,980
What?!

429
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:05,350
They couldn't jump!

430
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:06,390
It broke!

431
00:20:06,390 --> 00:20:10,000
The Tachibana Twins couldn't perform the Skylab Hurricane move.

432
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:10,810
Masao!

433
00:20:10,810 --> 00:20:11,520
Kazuo!

434
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:13,130
So this is as far as it goes, huh?

435
00:20:13,130 --> 00:20:14,200
Damn it!

436
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:16,610
It seems both of their legs are locked up.

437
00:20:16,610 --> 00:20:18,610
We barely escaped that one too.

438
00:20:18,610 --> 00:20:19,560
Yeah.

439
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:24,320
So what Tsubasa said about the move was true.

440
00:20:25,690 --> 00:20:27,000
Here it comes!

441
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:31,660
Nankatsu's captain Tsubasa has returned immediately after a short break.

442
00:20:31,660 --> 00:20:33,660
Good luck, Tsubasa!

443
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:35,310
Tsubasa, we trust you!

444
00:20:35,310 --> 00:20:37,880
We've been waiting for you, Tsubasa!

445
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:40,670
So you're back, Tsubasa.

446
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:41,580
Tsubasa!

447
00:20:41,580 --> 00:20:43,120
Is your shoulder okay?

448
00:20:43,120 --> 00:20:44,430
Yeah, it's fine.

449
00:20:44,430 --> 00:20:46,220
Sorry, Tsubasa.

450
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:47,820
We failed. The match is tied.

451
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:49,560
It's just a draw.

452
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:51,090
Don't worry, guys, don't worry!

453
00:20:51,090 --> 00:20:52,180
Tsubasa...

454
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:55,570
If they've caught up with us, all we have to do is take the lead again.

455
00:20:55,570 --> 00:20:59,320
Come on, let's show the pressure we showed in the first half again!

456
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:00,820
Yeah!

457
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:04,270
I guess we have to defend until our legs heal.

458
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:08,880
We can only use the Skylab Hurricane once more in this match.

459
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:11,860
Until then, we have to stop Nankatsu's attacks.

460
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:12,830
Yes!

461
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:16,330
The match will resume with Nankatsu's throw-in!

462
00:21:16,330 --> 00:21:21,590
Now back to a full 11 players, what kind of game will Nankatsu show?

463
00:21:22,570 --> 00:21:23,260
Tsubasa!

464
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:24,420
I trust you!

465
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:30,430
I can't just go to the goal. I have to avoid physical contact because of my shoulder.

466
00:21:30,430 --> 00:21:33,890
Then I'll continue as a playmaker.

467
00:21:33,890 --> 00:21:36,650
I won't score; I'll make others score.

468
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:41,980
The Tachibana twins are man-marking Taki and Kisugi.

469
00:21:41,980 --> 00:21:44,490
The twins have chosen to stay defensive.

470
00:21:44,490 --> 00:21:47,860
The others are also waiting slightly behind the midfield line.

471
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:52,700
Are they planning to protect this score until the Tachibana Twins' legs recover?

472
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:54,470
Hey, focus on the match!

473
00:21:54,470 --> 00:21:55,710
Here's my chance!

474
00:21:55,710 --> 00:21:57,170
Tsubasa, coming!

475
00:21:57,170 --> 00:21:59,230
I can't go to the goal.

476
00:21:59,230 --> 00:22:01,070
I can't use Kisugi or Taki either.

477
00:22:01,070 --> 00:22:04,170
Then there's only one way.

478
00:22:05,060 --> 00:22:05,970
What?!

479
00:22:13,290 --> 00:22:17,220
The only way is the Dead Leaf Shot!

